[{"answer":"Hi, Nicole.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/1.mp3"},{"answer":"As you know, we've got to decide on the best ways this university can reduce its waste.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/2.mp3"},{"answer":"You inspected the eastern campus, and I did the western buildings.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you do all the interviews as well?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I interviewed all the staff, who made some good observations,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/5.mp3"},{"answer":"and I interviewed some of the students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The students said little that was interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/7.mp3"},{"answer":"They don't seem to care that much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It was the cleaners, surprisingly, who revealed the most relevant facts.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/9.mp3"},{"answer":"That's not surprising to me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/10.mp3"},{"answer":"They empty all the bins, so they see the waste first-hand,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/11.mp3"},{"answer":"whereas the staff just throw things away without thinking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/12.mp3"},{"answer":"What item was most commonly disposed of?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it really depended on where I interviewed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/14.mp3"},{"answer":"In the cafeteria precinct,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/15.mp3"},{"answer":"obviously paper plates and cups were thrown away all over the place.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/16.mp3"},{"answer":"There was almost no attempt at recycling.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/17.mp3"},{"answer":"However, across the university in general,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/18.mp3"},{"answer":"it was paper copying that filled up most bins,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/19.mp3"},{"answer":"far more than plastic, or other forms of waste.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Do people care about this, then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, some do, if you can believe them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I must have interviewed about 30% of customers in the cafeteria,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and the results were mixed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Out of all the people I interviewed, well over half,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/25.mp3"},{"answer":"maybe about 55% of them, were quite honest about it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/26.mp3"},{"answer":"telling me that they had little concern.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/27.mp3"},{"answer":"The other fraction, 45%, were more troubled.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but do they do anything about it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Surprisingly, quite a significant percentage do do something,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/30.mp3"},{"answer":"even if they aren't particularly concerned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, small things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/32.mp3"},{"answer":"About 10% bring their own cups to the cafeteria, for example,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and at least 1/3 said they use recycling bins,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/34.mp3"},{"answer":"so, in total, it's an equal split between those who do something, or those who don't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/35.mp3"},{"answer":"So why do so many people remain inactive,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/36.mp3"},{"answer":"particularly over an issue they should care about more?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I think they do care, and many of them are prepared to do something.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Obviously, there's an element of laziness,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/39.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'd say that it's relatively small.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/40.mp3"},{"answer":"If they knew what to do, and if stringent systems existed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/41.mp3"},{"answer":"or if the importance of this was made clearer to them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure you'd see a much larger percentage of people actively working towards helping our environment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there's cause for optimism, at least.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Clearly then, there's a significant waste of paper here at this university,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/45.mp3"},{"answer":"so I've worked out one practical suggestion which could help reduce it -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/46.mp3"},{"answer":"specifically, the waste from the excess photocopying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me hear it, then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah obviously, for a start,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/49.mp3"},{"answer":"we've got to ensure that people, including the staff,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/50.mp3"},{"answer":"without exception, copy both sides of a page.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/51.mp3"},{"answer":"We can't tolerate single-sided copying. It's just far too wasteful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely. Just more trees being chopped down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/53.mp3"},{"answer":"But as people are doing copying,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/54.mp3"},{"answer":"there may be adjustments, and practice copying,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/55.mp3"},{"answer":"producing single-sided copies or blank pages not wanted and not intended for use.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/56.mp3"},{"answer":"These need to be deposited into a tray for intended recycling -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/57.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, for recopying onto the blank side of the page.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/58.mp3"},{"answer":"But people don't usually do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid it's just human nature.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/60.mp3"},{"answer":"No matter how unimportant the copying is, they prefer to use fresh paper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I agree with you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/62.mp3"},{"answer":"which is why you need to display these papers right in front of everyone,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/63.mp3"},{"answer":"with a clear sign, 'Please Reuse', to make it easy for them to do so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/64.mp3"},{"answer":"They still won't do it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I know. That's why you take some of these papers, and regularly stack them inside the copier,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/66.mp3"},{"answer":"in a special tray, once a day, say, in the morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's getting better, making it easier for them to use the paper,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/68.mp3"},{"answer":"but still, I'm afraid many won't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/69.mp3"},{"answer":"That's why you allow everyone to select this tray when copying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/70.mp3"},{"answer":"You distribute numbers or codes to every person,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/71.mp3"},{"answer":"giving them special access to this recycling tray.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Every time they use papers from this, it's tallied up to their account.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/73.mp3"},{"answer":"I know I'm sounding a bit negative, or even cynical here...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/74.mp3"},{"answer":"but why should they bother using that tray?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Because the person who does the most copying from this recycling tray gets, say, a cinema pass,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/76.mp3"},{"answer":"or lottery ticket, or some other sort of reward.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, right! Now that's a system which might just work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's trial it in the office and see what happens.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/47-research-on-university-waste-2022-03-25-09-53-03/79.mp3"}]
